turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="e58d2776-9ac0-420a-b5cc-f2d26238a5ad" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-t-mini" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="169">Haan, <strong data-start="6" data-end="167">agar tum isi image ko Android Studio mein background ke liye use karna chahte ho, to image ko download karke project ke <code data-start="128" data-end="138">drawable</code> folder mein add karna hai.</strong> ✅</p>
<p data-start="171" data-end="458">Lekin ek important baat: jo image abhi chat mein dikh rahi hai, <strong data-start="235" data-end="332">woh full-screen background ke liye bahut lambi hai aur usme login UI bhi already bana hua hai</strong>. Is image ko directly background banaoge to tumhare real <code data-start="390" data-end="400">EditText</code> aur <code data-start="405" data-end="413">Button</code> ke upar ek fake login UI bhi dikh sakta hai.</p>
<p data-start="460" data-end="559">Isliye better hai ki main <strong data-start="486" data-end="533">sirf top travel background wala clean image</strong> alag bana du, aur actual:</p>
<ul data-start="560" data-end="615">
<li data-section-id="yclr2e" data-start="560" data-end="573">
<p data-start="562" data-end="573">Email field</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1w5j8qd" data-start="574" data-end="590">
<p data-start="576" data-end="590">Password field</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1la8uhp" data-start="591" data-end="605">
<p data-start="593" data-end="605">Login button</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1npznoe" data-start="606" data-end="615">
<p data-start="608" data-end="615">Sign Up</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="617" data-end="645">Android XML se banaye jayen.</p>
<p data-start="647" data-end="799" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node=""><strong data-start="647" data-end="700">Abhi wali full image download karke use mat karo.</strong><br data-start="700" data-end="703">
Main tumhare liye <strong data-start="721" data-end="746">sirf background image</strong> bana deta hoon, jo Android app mein proper fit hogi.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Response actions" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy response" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-c71f477f.svg#7fccfb" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Rate response" data-testid="feedback-turn-action-button" id="radix-_r_1tq_" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed"><span class="touch:w-10 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-c71f477f.svg#c1e6c4" fill="currentColor"></use></sv